     <aside class="mg-note"><h3>Suffixes Change the Story</h3><p><b>K</b> koa · <b>H</b> Hawaiian · <b>G</b> gut-string · <b>C</b> classical · <b>NY</b> New Yorker · <b>S</b> special or custom, and sometimes later 12-fret usage · <b>E</b> factory electronics. Treat the complete stamp as the model.</p></aside>
